<title>ESTONIA: BOURSE TO DECIDE ON RAKVERE TRADE.</title>
<headline>BOURSE TO DECIDE ON RAKVERE TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tallinn stock exchange will make a decision on restarting trade in Rakvere meat factory shares on the morning of June 19 before the bourse opens, officials said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>&quot;I believe the decision will be made by 9.30,&quot; managing director Helo Meigas told Reuters.</p>
<p>Rakvere shares were suspended in the second hour of trade on Wednesday after the securities commission asked the police to investigate a possible insider trading case.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
